    "/api/portal/contact/send-message": {
      "post": {
        "tags": [
          "Portal"
        ],
        "summary": "Send message to contacts.",
        "description": "Sends a plain message to one or more contacts in an organization, over one or more communication channels.\n\n**Authentication:** Include `X-API-KEY` in the request header.\n\n**Behavior:**\n- `ContactIds` selects which contacts receive the message.\n- Delivery is asynchronous — the request succeeds once the message has been handed off for processing, independent of whether delivery to each contact ultimately succeeds.\n\n**Communication Channels (`TypeIds`):**\n| Value | Channel |\n|-------|---------|\n| `1` | InApp |\n| `2` | SMS |\n| `3` | Email |\n\n**Response:** `204 No Content` on success, with no response body. On failure, returns an error response describing what went wrong.",
